This project has TWO licences, because it combines original software with
Government of India open data:

  • SOFTWARE (all code in app/ and pipeline/) ............... MIT License (below)
  • DATA (everything derived from the Local Government Directory and boundary
    datasets, i.e. the JSON / GeoJSON files under data/) ...... Government Open
    Data License – India (GODL-India).
    Canonical text: https://data.gov.in/government-open-data-license-india

When reusing the data files, you must attribute the source:

  Contains administrative data from the Local Government Directory (LGD),
  Ministry of Panchayati Raj, Government of India, used under the Government
  Open Data License – India (GODL-India), accessed via the data.gov.in
  open-data API.

